    Array([[22., 17.],
           [30., 32.]], dtype=float32)

    Specifying ``mode = 'valid'`` returns only the portion of 2D convolution
    where the two arrays fully overlap:

    >>> jax.scipy.signal.convolve2d(x, y, mode='valid')
    Array([[22., 17.],
           [30., 32.]], dtype=float32)

